SkateGTA (GTA V plugin, skate-ped, skate-music)

skate-gta/src/live/ (bounds.rs, clean.rs, grid.rs, level.rs, rails.rs, and
locate.rs as a Rust port of host/src/physics_level.cpp) is taken from SK8V,
https://github.com/becaring/SK8V, Copyright 2026 becaring, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
SK8V's live reader is adapted from Sol4ra's LS-Skate-LiveCollision.

The Skate crates this builds on come from
https://github.com/chasmlol/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup (see its licenses).

No Skate 3, GTA V or other retail assets are included: the scripts build
everything from the player's own copies.
